            <ArticleTitle>Subarachnoid hemorrhage presenting as post-dural puncture headache: a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>109-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of subarachnoid hemorrhage following spinal anesthesia for prostate radioactive seed implantation is reported. The implications of the differential diagnosis of post-dural puncture headache are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
